{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05613","headline":"三日绿潭篇 · 万齐融","name":"三日绿潭篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"春潭滉漾接隋宫，宫阙连延潭水东。\n苹苔嫩色涵波绿，桃李新花照底红。\n垂菱布藻如妆镜，丽日晴天相照暎。\n素影沈沈对蝶飞，金沙砾砾窥鱼泳。\n佳人祓禊赏韶年，倾国倾城并可怜。\n拾翠总来芳树下，踏青争遶绿潭边。\n公子王孙恣游翫，沙阳水曲情无厌。\n禽浮似挹羽觞杯，鳞跃疑投水心劒。\n金鞍玉勒骋轻肥，落絮红尘拥路飞。\n绿水残霞催席散，画楼初月待人归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"万齐融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05613.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05613","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}